 "sentences": [
  "A musician released one final album before dying.",
  "David Berman founded the indie rock band Silver Jews.",
  "He wrote multifaceted lyrics about substance abuse and depression.",
  "After a 2003 suicide attempt, he dissolved the band.",
  "Berman then withdrew from public life for several years.",
  "In 2019, he returned with the project Purple Mountains.",
  "He died by suicide one month after that release."
